  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Southern Border, Xiao Yan finds white dazzling flame burning in a mountain crevice behind a Shang clan village. The field covers at least two hundred paces. Light fire is a type of special fire and a rank five Gu material. It can be used to refine rank five light path or fire path Gu worms. From a Gu Immortal view, it contains fire path and light path dao marks.",
