        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The closer one gets to this Gu material, the angrier one becomes without reason. Xiao Yan keeps a basin-sized lump with fire path methods and judges that the full field is beyond one person, though most of it can still be taken with help. Gu materials like light fire spread and grow rapidly by day; at night that growth is suppressed.",
